type":"math","value":"v_0=\\frac{qBR}{m}"},{"type":"text","value":"1分\n"},{"type":"text","value":"（2）由几何规律可知，圆形磁场边界，出射速度与磁场区域半径的夹角等于入射速度与磁场区域半径的夹角。\n入射时："},{"type":"math","value":"\\sin\\theta=\\frac{R-\\frac{R}{2}}{R}=\\frac{1}{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"1分\n"},{"type":"math","value":"\\theta=30^\\circ"},{"type":"text","value":"1分\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/aa3b7d248e40b53182da11d50b86d4ddab8966144ed837e0533f39517f73267a.png","width":556,"height":467,"width_mm":70.5},{"type":"text","value":"（3）"},{"type":"math","value":"qv_0B_{\\text{上}}=m\\frac{v_0^2}{r};\\quad r=L/2"},{"type":"text","value":"1分\n"},{"type":"text","value":"设粒子从 O 点进入第 2 象限后，经磁场偏转再次经过 x 轴时所在位置离 O 点距离为 x"},{"type":"math","value":"x=2r\\cos\\theta=2\\frac{mv_0\\cos\\theta}{qB_{\\text{上}}}=2\\frac{mv_y}{qB_{\\text{上}}}"},{"type":"text","value":"1分\n"},{"type":"text","value":"所以粒子从 O 点入射时，y 方向速度越大，偏转位移 x 越大。\n由于初始粒子沿 y 轴方向均匀分布，故"},{"type":"math","value":"\\theta=30^\\circ"},{"type":"text","value":"的粒子刚好击中孔的右边界"},{"type":"math","value":"x_{\\text{右}}=2\\frac{mv_0\\cos30^\\circ}{qB_{\\text{上}}}=\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}L"},{"type":"text","value":"1分\n"},{"type":"text","value":"故小孔宽度为："},{"type":"math","value":"L-x_{\\text{右}}=\\left(1-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}\\right)L"},{"type":"text","value":"1分\n"},{"type":"text","value":"（4）k 越大，x 越小。故：\n（i）当从 O 点沿 y 轴正向入射时，若击中小孔的右边界，则无粒子能通过小孔。"},{"type":"math","value":"x_{\\text{右}}=2\\frac{mv_0}{qkB_{\\text{上}}}=\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}L\\rightarrow k=\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{3}}"},{"type":"text","value":"，\n"},{"type":"math","value":"k>\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{3}},\\quad\\eta=0"},{"type":"text","value":"1分\n"},{"type":"text","value":"（ii）若"},{"type":"math","value":"1\\leq k\\leq\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{3}}"},{"type":"text","value":"，则偏转位移最大的粒子能通过小孔，击中小孔右边界的粒子从 O 点入射时，其与 y 轴的夹角为"},{"type":"math","value":"\\alpha"},{"type":"text","value":"，满足关系："},{"type":"math","value":"x_{\\text{右}}=2\\frac{mv_0\\cos\\alpha}{qkB_{\\text{上}}}=\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}L"},{"type":"text","value":"，得"},{"type":"math"